"type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-12-22T16:59:23Z","updated_at":"2020-12-22T16:59:23Z","body":"@shilman Hello! Thank you for reading this issue.\r\n\r\n@storybook/client-api/queryparams.ts imports qs to use the func parse. Qs does not have a default export, the following should work fine:\r\n\r\nimport { parse } from 'qs';   <--- If you want to just use the parse func, as is the case right now. This change requires the usage to change from 'qs.parse(...)' to 'parse(...)'\r\n\r\nor\r\n\r\nimport * as qs from 'qs'; <--- If you want to import all funcs in qs and use qs as-is\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/comments/749657950/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"paulbrittain","id":7349615,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNDk2MTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7349615?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulbrittain","html_url":"https://github.com/paulbrittain","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulbrittain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulbrittain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulbrittain/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulbrittain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulbrittain/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulbrittain/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulbrittain/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulbrittain/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulbrittain/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":4140992978,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50NDE0MDk5Mjk3OA==","url":"https://api.github.com